-- NULL MEN LOGHA TANYA ---------------------------------- main.franco.kl  K0906

Mafeesh f Kalam `null` wala `nil` wala `undefined`. El qeema elly momken tekoon mesh mawgooda no3ha `ekhtiyari[T]`, w 7alet el gheyab tetketeb `mafeesh`.

2│     khali count = null
                     ^^^^

Garrab: `mafeesh`

Mosa3da: Ekteb `mafeesh`, w ekhali no3 el variable `ekhtiyari[T]`, 3ashan el compiler yeraga3 kol makan beye2rah.

